      "claim": "The waiting-period-shortfall route under POL-NS-06 is closed. The effective in-geofence dwell is 400 seconds against the 180-second STANDARD minimum, a surplus of 220 seconds (shortfall_sec = -220), so no shortfall exists to refund. There is also only one in-geofence interval (run_count = 1), so there is no second interval for limb (i) to accumulate. In any event the traffic-advisory artifact EV-ADVIS-02721-01 is MISSING with weight_multiplier 0.0 - its absence is citable, and it means no advisory exists that could have made holding position unlawful or that could alter the required minimum.",
